    lead = "The FBR Active Taxpayer List (ATL) is one of the most financially important documents in Pakistan. Being on the ATL as a Lahore resident means you pay significantly lower withholding tax rates on property purchases, vehicle registration, banking transactions, and dozens of other financial activities. Being off the ATL can cost you Rs 50,000 to Rs 500,000 or more every year in extra withholding taxes. Kamboh Associates helps Lahore residents get on the ATL quickly, stay on it permanently, and take full advantage of the financial benefits ATL status provides."
    faq1q = "What is the ATL and why is it important for Lahore residents?"
    faq1a = "The Active Taxpayer List (ATL) is FBR's list of registered taxpayers who have filed their income tax returns. Being on the ATL gives you filer status which means lower withholding tax rates on property, vehicles, banking, utilities, and many other transactions."
    faq2q = "How do I get on the FBR Active Taxpayer List in Lahore?"
    faq2a = "To get ATL status: register NTN with FBR, file your income tax return for the current tax year, wait for FBR to process (usually 24-48 hours). ATL is updated every week. After filing, your name appears on ATL within 3-7 days."
    faq3q = "How much money does ATL status save me in Lahore?"
    faq3a = "Significant savings: Property purchase tax halved (3% filer vs 6% non-filer on Rs 10M = Rs 300,000 saving), vehicle registration reduced by 50%, banking transaction tax reduced, utility bills reduced. Most Lahore property owners save Rs 100,000-500,000 per year."
    faq4q = "How do I check if I am on the ATL in Pakistan?"
    faq4a = "Check ATL status at: atl.fbr.gov.pk. Enter your CNIC number. If your name appears, you are on ATL. If not, you need to file your tax return. You can also check via FBR IRIS portal or by calling FBR helpline 051-111-772-772."
    faq5q = "How long does it take to get on the ATL after filing in Lahore?"
    faq5a = "After filing your income tax return, ATL status is typically updated within 3 to 7 business days. We track your ATL status after filing and notify you once your name appears on the FBR Active Taxpayer List."
